       ----*** Welcome to the Enigmatic Local Area N3tw0rk ***---

You are are about to transform into a humble byte of data, on the brink of an 
extraordinary adventure! As you step into this labyrinth of circuits and 
signals, remember: every byte has a role, and every connection is a clue.

Navigate through the whimsical layers of our TCP/IP-like network, and seek 
out the elusive information that Kenneth might have sent to its accomplices.
The data might be hidden deep within the network's intricate pathways.

This experience is crafted with (questionable) care using the CD Gamedriver 
and built upon a (very much reimagined) CD Mudlib. A tip of the hat to 
those who paved the way!

Feeling a bit lost or in need of guidance? Just type 'help' - it's your 
trusty companion in this digital odyssey.
